            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-29T01:32:31.831151+00:00",
            "notes": "Take frontliners power to give you/your team overhealth, which is more useful than healing since it is instant and cannot be reduced by items like cybervenom. \n\nThis damage mitigation, combined with biotic field healing, will make you/your team very tanky and hard to burst down.\n\nIf you didn't get it last round, now take vanadium injection for another big boost to your survivability.\n\nIf you are especially concerned about your teammates, replace phantasmic flux/superflexor with rapid response radius to better help them receive overhealth from frontliners.\n\nBuild variations:\n- For an aggressive variation with high AOE damage from biotic fields, take \"back off\" this round and frontliners on round 7 (build code: 1B2AN).\n- If you do take \"back off\", get rapid response radius first, then phantasmic/vanadium, and finally some of these items: sonic recharger/superflexor/champions kit (AP), iridescent iris (CDR), cybervenom/liquid nitrogen (debuff), divine intervention/nebula conduit (HP). \n- For a more selfish variation better for flanking/diving, take \"on me!\" this round and frontliners on round 7 (rest of build is same).",
